<title>USA: United National Q4 shr $0.82 vs $0.50.</title>
<headline>United National Q4 shr $0.82 vs $0.50.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEWATER, N.J. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.82		    $0.50</p>
<p> Net			  3,143		    1,898</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$3.01		    $2.19</p>
<p> Net			 11,460		    8,374</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: In 1995 net income included one-time charges of $2,089,000 or $0.55 per share related to the acquisition of New Era Bank and formation of United Financial Services, a third party service provider.</p>
<p>The company reported total assets at December 31 were $1,037,549,000.</p>
<p>Full company name is United National Bancorp.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
